# ChatPlatform ownership (mandatory)

Full gate: `pnpm run check:chat-platform`

## Single owner

| Concern | Owner |
|---------|--------|
| Chat layout shell | `components/chat-platform.tsx` |
| Keyboard viewport read | `lib/chat-platform/viewport.ts` |
| Active prompt visibility | `lib/chat-platform/visibility.ts` |
| Telemetry | `lib/chat-platform/telemetry.ts` |
| Internal hook | `hooks/use-keyboard-chat-layout.ts` (ChatPlatform only) |

## Native vs web (Android)

- **Native (`android/MainActivity.kt`):** resize only (`adjustResize` + IME inset events). Never inject `--vv-height` for chat.
- **Web (`ChatPlatform`):** visibility + scroll only. Never subtract keyboard inset from container height on Android WebView.

## Do NOT (outside ChatPlatform)

- Add keyboard offsets, padding hacks, or spacer views for chat
- Add `keyboardHeight`, `keyboardInset` calculations in pages/components
- Add viewport shrinking (`innerHeight - inset`, `--vv-height` overrides) in feature code
- Add `scrollToEnd`, `scrollIntoView`, or custom chat scroll logic in pages
- Import `use-keyboard-chat-layout` from feature code
- Import deprecated `chat-thread-shell` in pages

## DO

- Use `<ChatPlatform surface="…" activePromptId={…} />` for every conversational text UI
- Tag active Amy bubbles with `promptId` / `data-chat-prompt-id`
- Run `pnpm run check:chat-platform` before merging chat/layout PRs
- Real-device certification required before release: `pnpm run check:chat-platform-certification`

## PRs touching chat keyboard

Must pass `check:chat-platform` and must not expand forbidden patterns in `scripts/check-chat-platform.ts`.
